[38;5;252m1. [1mCalm open marks.[0m[38;5;252m Underline marks the text a mark is about. A dim [38;2;201;214;227m[48;2;26;38;48m↳ N kind · who time · msg[38;5;252m[49m line goes under it. The kind is a word, never a colour. There   [39m
[38;5;252mare no background fills and only one cue per meaning (qh9ep1 check 9). The raw [38;2;201;214;227m[48;2;26;38;48m.Request ...[38;5;252m[49m text is not drawn.                                                [39m
[38;5;252m2. [1mJump key [0m[38;2;201;214;227m[48;2;26;38;48m'[38;5;252m[49m ([38;2;201;214;227m[48;2;26;38;48m"[38;5;252m[49m goes back). The cursor is [38;2;201;214;227m[48;2;26;38;48m>[38;5;252m[49m, and the dim lifts on that one mark. Nothing else changes.                                                       [39m
[38;5;252m3. [1mMark mode [0m[38;2;201;214;227m[48;2;26;38;48mm[1m[38;5;252m[49m.[0m[38;5;252m The selection is bold, and bold appears only here. Tab steps the unit (sentence → word → paragraph → item). H/L make a free span ([38;2;201;214;227m[48;2;26;38;48m.on[38;5;252m[49m). The   [39m
[38;5;252mfooter lists [38;2;201;214;227m[48;2;26;38;48mc ? r[38;5;252m[49m.                                                                                                                                           [39m
[38;5;252m4. [38;2;201;214;227m[48;2;26;38;48mr[1m[38;5;252m[49m request.[0m[38;5;252m The input opens where the ↳ line will appear. A dim [38;2;201;214;227m[48;2;26;38;48mwrites:[38;5;252m[49m line previews the exact text.                                                       [39m
[38;5;252m5. [38;2;201;214;227m[48;2;26;38;48m?[1m[38;5;252m[49m question on a span of check 2.[0m[38;5;252m Records [38;2;201;214;227m[48;2;26;38;48m.prev:.Item .on:"Should, Can or Do"[38;5;252m[49m.                                                                              [39m
[38;5;252m6. [1mAnswer input under the mark.[0m[38;5;252m You open the task from ASKED. The cursor is on the question, and [38;2;201;214;227m[48;2;26;38;48ma[38;5;252m[49m answers under it. The check's own text is not changed.     [39m
[38;5;252m7. [1mAfter both resolves.[0m[38;5;252m Clean prose, and FILES lists history.sdd. This frame matches after.md.                                                                [39m
