[38;5;252m• Markdown, [38;2;201;214;227m[48;2;26;38;48mpandoc 3.9.0.2[38;5;252m[49m, niced, [38;2;201;214;227m[48;2;26;38;48m-f commonmark|gfm|markdown -t html[38;5;252m[49m on before.md and after.md: all 6 exit 0. Inside the mark runs: [1m0 HTML elements[0m[38;5;252m in all 3 [39m
[38;5;252mflavours. Marks stay plain text in the paragraph or list item they follow. With commonmark and gfm, the plain-text output holds both runs byte-identical.     [39m
